      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, i'll try the dark room thing. but i really cant sit around all day staring at a wall... i have a deadline in two hours. do u think like ginger tea or maybe some magnesium might help clear the head feeling faster? i just need to snap out of it so i can focus on my laptop.",
